Unit proof: trim_from_last_delimiter's contract (empty when the
delimiter is absent; otherwise the exact prefix up to the LAST
delimiter) proven over ALL printable strings up to length 4.
Was KNOWNBUG until 2026-07-20: a derived-to-base struct VALUE typecast
(libstdc++'s EBO allocator base) reached the solver and was havocked;
value_set_dereference now lowers the offset-0 prefix dereference to the
base subobject.  g++/clang++ accept the harness and it verifies at
runtime.
